            "step_number": 5,
            "action": "FILTER_STERILIZE",
            "description": "Mix components, sterilize by filtration through a 0.22 ï¿½m filter and store at 4C."
          },
          {
            "step_number": 6,
            "action": "POUR_PLATES",
            "description": "Dispense the medium into sterilized plastic tubes (e.g., 5 ml medium in 15 ml of plastic tubes) and add 100-200 ï¿½l of culture solution. Incubate the cultures at 37C for 1-3 days. When the color of the medium turns from yellow to orange or red, subculture into the new medium. After color change, the strain can be stored at 4C for 1-2 weeks."
          }
        ],
