ield. Exact per-liter heading: Gram & Mol amounts are per Liter of medium.\", \"status\": \"correct\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1245\", \"snippet\": \"Sodium Pyruvate Sodium pyruvate SEED-cpd00020#cpd00971## 0.80 0.01\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Source: KOMODO ModelSEED | ID: 1245 | DSMZ Medium: 1245 (mediadive.medium:1245) | Aerobic: No\\n\\nSuperseded historical provenance, not a current formulation claim:\\nCommercial Product: LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation)\\nSupplier: Multiple suppliers (Difco, Sigma, etc.)\\nCatalog: Multiple (L3522 Sigma, 244520 BD)\\nSource: https://www.laboratorynotes.com/preparation-of-luria-bertani-lb-miller-broth/\\nAccessed: 2026-03-28\\n\\nConstituent composition researched from product specification.\\n\\nPreserve the exact KOMODO Gram Amounts and nulls as source-specific assertions. No provider molar aggregation or copied DSMZ formulation replaces these rows. pH metadata is retained without inferring a missing value.\\n\\nComplete source tables were inspected. Reconstructed ingredient/stock nodes retain source-specific amounts and uncertainties; historical flattened amounts, false supplier-tagged LB ingredients and unsupported interpretations are archived in append-only history. Existing unrelated metadata and prior evidence remain preserved, not recertified.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1245\", \"snippet\": \"PH Info: 6.8 - 7.2\"}, {\"old_field\": \"parent_media\", \"field\": \"parent_media\", \"old\": {\"path\": \"data/normalized_yaml/bacterial/oteb_medium.yaml\", \"relationship\": \"SOURCE_DUPLICATE\", \"id\": \"CultureMech:000704\", \"name\": \"oteb_medium\", \"notes\": \"KOMODO record explicitly cites DSMZ Medium 1245; one unlinked DSMZ parent record exists and the loca